{"1172690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ESCAPE: The Cabin", "steam_appid": 1172690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4780980], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172690/extras/262f092f8f85fa0794dc827cbf14b12e.avif?t=1785967142\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake inside a remote wooden cabin with no memory of how you got there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The doors are locked. The windows will not save you. Somewhere beyond the walls, your captor is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a desperate attempt to escape soon becomes something far more disturbing. Every locked compartment, cryptic note, broken machine, and hidden code uncovers another piece of a mystery someone desperately wants buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172690/extras/990185a6eff5c68c6e41a75c422ae0bb.avif?t=1785967142\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a detailed first-person environment filled with hidden compartments, locked doors, secret mechanisms, and interactive clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search drawers, inspect objects, combine items, uncover hidden areas, and piece together the truth hidden within the cabin's walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172690/extras/4113ac3d852b492417df3670bde0794f.avif?t=1785967142\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack safes, decipher codes, repair machinery, manipulate switches, unlock hidden pathways, and solve over 70 interconnected puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some challenges require logic. Others demand observation, experimentation, and connecting clues scattered throughout the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172690/extras/9ff41b8100b9451a821eec49230a5748.avif?t=1785967142\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional escape room games, the cabin changes between playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues, item locations, puzzle setups, and puzzle solutions can all be procedurally generated, ensuring that no two escape attempts unfold exactly the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the cabin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But never rely on memorising the answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172690/extras/1fc61d67ce96cc7f4acc63cda53428dd.avif?t=1785967142\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up, inspect, combine, dismantle, and use items to solve puzzles and unlock new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday objects may conceal clues, tools, codes, or something far more important than they first appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172690/extras/e9154a1fb966dc6d52e95a7d360ce66b.avif?t=1785967142\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape is only part of the mystery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who brought you here?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why were you chosen?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what is hidden beneath the cabin's ordinary appearance?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you explore, the more unsettling the answers become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172690/extras/88438c7e099979143aa7dbacbab4c9c8.avif?t=1785967142\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 puzzles and mechanisms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated clues, item locations, and puzzle solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration and investigation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item inspection, combination, and interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden compartments and secret areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable escape attempts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172690/extras/979fb74b6488c37fe90b65cc11938724.avif?t=1785967142\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172690/extras/262f092f8f85fa0794dc827cbf14b12e.avif?t=1785967142\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake inside a remote wooden cabin with no memory of how you got there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The doors are locked. The windows will not save you. Somewhere beyo